ing-relaxed mb-4","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Basic"}]," uses Google Chirp3-HD voices. Clean, intelligible, but obviously synthetic. At 1 credit per minute, it works for casual viewing."]}],["$","p","15",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Standard"}]," uses ElevenLabs Flash with preset voices. Noticeably more natural intonation and rhythm. 3 credits per minute."]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Premium"}]," uses ElevenLabs Dubbing API with automatic voice cloning. The dubbed version sounds like the original speaker but in your language. 6 credits per minute."]}],["$","h2","19",{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Pricing"}],["$","p","21",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["20 free credits to start. Packs: $20 for 200 credits, $50 for 550 credits, $120 for 1800 credits. No subscription required."]}],["$","h2","23",{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"What impressed us"}],["$","p","25",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Premium voice cloning is genuinely good. In a test with an English tech review, the Czech dubbed version preserved the speaker's tone and pacing. Background music stayed clean throughout."]}],["$","h2","27",{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"What could improve"}],["$","p","29",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Multi-speaker videos with overlapping dialogue still trip up the system. Auto-detection occasionally misidentifies regional accents. The processing queue can stack up during peak hours."]}],"$L10","$L11","$L12"]}],"$L13"]}]
